@Bettina Kroll: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday, Nov 2, 2025 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics changed hands on **Monday, November 3, 2025**. It describes the handoff as "tomorrow, 2025-11-03," with the terminal 4 drayage gate export queued for that morning's handoff.

The digest doesn't name who the account moved to, so I can't confirm from it that the new owner is Kwame. If you need that for the tracker, check with Kwame or Ruth.

Be careful not to mix this up with Saltmarsh Provisions. A separate digest has that account changing hands on Oct 6, 2025. Also, "PHL" is also the shorthand for Covey & Lark Retail, which is now Pellow Home Living.
